From 9f9462528f21faa42ec3a7296df3d07c34db9fb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:32:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Allow proven internal JML continuation backedges

Validate unnamed same-bank backward landings at decoded exact widths and zero local stack depth. Use the existing interpreter owner handoff without promoting an internal address to a function root.

Validation: Python v2 403/403, shared C suite, 32 complete and 768 event tail comparisons, and the Super Tennis 4816-frame replay.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
